      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRUCIA (8) came off a seven-week break to score over 870m here two runs back. Took on a Class 6 at Eagle Farm last start which was far too rich. Beautifully weighted after Lenton's claim and she looks a huge chance back in her right race. GITALONG (1) had won three from four on the non-tab circuit before being outclassed in the Moree Town Plate last time out. Won with 68.5kgs in a BM60 at Roma earlier in the prep so he carries weight well. Definite contender. THUNDERING SOUL (2) returns after an 11-week break. Good fresh performer who won a recent trial. Successful here twice from four visits and another big run looks likely. COMMAND APPROVED (7) was beaten comfortably here at this trip last start when second-up from a spell. Four-time winner at the journey so he must be given another chance. ELECTED (3) will find this easier than his fifth at Eagle Farm last time. Should be cherry ripe at the third run back.",
